    "id": "GH-11-pre-q3",
    "type": "single",
    "question": "不用计算器，利用 f(x)=√x 在 x=4 处的一阶 Taylor 近似估算 √4.1，结果最接近哪一项？",
    "options": [
      {
        "value": "A",
        "label": "2.025"
      },
      {
        "value": "B",
        "label": "2.050"
      },
      {
        "value": "C",
        "label": "2.100"
      },
      {
        "value": "D",
        "label": "1.975"
      }
    ],
    "answer": [
      "A"
    ],
    "analysis": "f(4)=2，f'(x)=1/(2√x)，所以 f'(4)=1/4。在 x=4 处线性化得 √x≈2+(1/4)(x-4)。代入 x=4.1，得到 2+0.025=2.025，选 A。",
